  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Political Economy Analysis for Policy and programming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for this investment supports consultancy services to provide political economy analysis (PEA) training to DFAT staff to help staff conduct, manage and integrate political economy analysis into their work. It includes: foundational PEA briefings; practitioner-level PEA training; online interactive practitioner-level PEA training; and bespoke PEA training for staff at post.</narrative>
  </description>
